A run naming no `--output` prints a markdown table: a header row over the union of the rows'
keys, a separator row, then one row per match.

-- fixtures/cwd/.booping --
project_name: probe
vault_path: ./vault
-- fixtures/cwd/vault/plans/alpha/index.md --
---
title: Alpha
status: ready-for-dev
---

body
-- fixtures/cwd/vault/plans/beta/index.md --
---
title: Beta
status: done
---

body
-- cmd --
booping query --glob 'plans/*/index.md'
-- exit --
0
-- stdout --
| title | status | path | slug |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| Alpha | ready-for-dev | plans/alpha/index.md | alpha |
| Beta | done | plans/beta/index.md | beta |
-- stderr --
